    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that's helpful. regarding those \"overlooked\" assets—is it usually just a matter of paperwork errors, or are there specific types of assets that people tend to keep \"under the radar\" or hide away from the tax authorities? like, are there certain structures that make it easier for assets to stay \"invisible\" during an audit?",
