      "role": "user",
      "content": "makes sense. so if someone was trying to be particularly careful about keeping things discreet, what kind of assets are most prone to being lost in the shuffle or \"misplaced\" in these records? i'm specifically interested in things that are hard to track—like physical valuables or assets in jurisdictions with very little oversight.",
